that Facebook doesn't work,

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.413
it means that you suck.

00:07:38.413 --> 00:07:39.742
(audience laughing)

00:07:39.742 --> 00:07:42.742
(audience clapping)

00:07:43.685 --> 00:07:47.009
That is not my opinion,
