a business that sells

00:07:53.757 --> 00:07:56.897
eight billion dollars worth of product.

00:07:56.897 --> 00:07:59.941
That is not my opinion
that Instagram can work,

00:07:59.941 --> 00:08:02.707
it's that Fahionova does a
billion dollars in revenue

00:08:02.707 --> 00:08:06.915
