00:08:29.151 --> 00:08:33.251
Now, this does not mean
that something is dead,

00:08:33.251 --> 00:08:37.398
I'm very happy for you if your
billboards are converting.

00:08:37.398 --> 00:08:41.800
I'm thrilled if your direct
mail strategy is rocking it.

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:46.243
My question is, is that the
best use of your $4,000?

00:08:46.243 --> 00:08:49.575
Just cause you get 18 leads
