00:08:52.584 --> 00:08:54.719
This is the debate at hand.

00:08:54.719 --> 00:08:57.093
If there is anybody who's
confused that this is

00:08:57.093 --> 00:08:59.939
the single most important
thing in our society

00:08:59.939 --> 00:09:01.837
